/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 48 0 R
/E (Rising from a year-long funding freeze, SWERVO Robotics returns to the competitive arena as a fully self-sustained engineering force. Our mission extends beyond building high-performance competitive robots; we are actively pioneering a highly inclusive future for competitive youth STEM. By introducing a unique dual-team operational model, we maintain an elite drive team focused on top-tier engineering milestones while simultaneously running an internal developmental league. This structure ensures that any student, regardless of prior technical background or economic barriers, has immediate, hands-on access to advanced mechanical design and open-source software development.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
